# Ruwaq Development Roadmap

North star: **Architectural Digest of Saudi real estate** — editorial first, Ruwaq PRO directory second, proposal SaaS as secret weapon.

## Current maturity (baseline audit)

| Area | Score | Notes |
|------|-------|-------|
| Editorial vision | 6/10 | Structure exists; content cadence weak |
| Home Tours | 7/10 | Off-plan strong; completed tours were empty |
| Magazine rhythm | 3/10 | No daily/weekly stories feed |
| PRO Directory | 5/10 | Built; mostly seed data |
| Proposal SaaS | 8/10 | Strong MVP |
| Revenue | 2/10 | BILLING_ENABLED=false; manual ops |

